d reports by the\n  console engineering team, and any inaccuracies found in review are corrected.\n\n## HLR Traceability\n\n- HLR-4 (P2): documentation explains the reports and safe reclamation steps — covered by\n  this epic.\n"}}],"model":"rits/zai-org/glm-5-3","stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":45257,"output_tokens":0},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":"chatcmpl-tool-96a28f8864c19364","agent_id":"a282a50d93546ae84","session_id":"0862132f-9e49-42c1-8562-e738ee3eb185","uuid":"3249357a-80db-404c-8219-27c5dceb223d","timestamp":"2026-10-26T10:08:15.598Z","subagent_type":"general-purpose","task_description":"Decompose RHAISTRAT-9016"}
